      "id": "testimonial-1",
      "name": "Snap Scroll Carousel",
      "description": "A modern, touch-friendly horizontal scrolling carousel for testimonials",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .tst1-wrap{padding:80px 20px;background:#f8fafc;font-family:sans-serif;overflow:hidden;}\n                          .tst1-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px;}\n                          .tst1-head h2{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,40px);font-weight:900;color:#0f172a;margin:0 0 10px;}\n                          .tst1-head p{color:#64748b;font-size:18px;}\n                          .tst1-scroll{display:flex;gap:20px;overflow-x:auto;padding:20px;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scroll-padding:20px;scrollbar-width:none;}\n                          .tst1-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}\n                          .tst1-card{flex:0 0 400px;scroll-snap-align:center;background:#fff;padding:40px;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);position:relative;}\n                          .tst1-quote-icon{font-size:60px;color:#e2e8f0;position:absolute;top:20px;right:30px;line-height:1;font-family:serif;}\n                          .tst1-stars{color:#fbbf24;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:20px;display:flex;gap:4px;}\n                          .tst1-text{color:#334155;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 30px;font-weight:500;}\n                          .tst1-user{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;}\n                          .tst1-av{width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;}\n                          .tst1-name{font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin:0 0 2px;}\n                          .tst1-role{color:#64748b;font-size:13px;margin:0;}\n                          @media(max-width:600px){.tst1-card{flex:0 0 85vw;padding:30px;}}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"tst1-wrap\">\n                          <div class=\"tst1-head\">\n                            <h2>Loved by Thousands</h2>\n                            <p>See what our amazing customers have to say.</p>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"tst1-scroll\">\n                            <div class=\"tst1-card\">\n                              <div class=\"tst1-quote-icon\">\"</div>\n                              <div class=\"tst1-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                              <p class=\"tst1-text\">\"This product completely transformed the way we do business. The interface is intuitive, and the support team is just incredible. Highly recommended!\"</p>\n                              <div class=\"tst1-user\">\n                                <img class=\"tst1-av\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?q=80&w=200&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"User\">\n                                <div><h4 class=\"tst1-name\">Sarah Jenkins</h4><p class=\"tst1-role\">CEO at TechFlow</p></div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tst1-card\">\n                              <div class=\"tst1-quote-icon\">\"</div>\n                              <div class=\"tst1-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                              <p class=\"tst1-text\">\"I've tried dozens of similar tools, but none come close to the polish and reliability of this one. It's a game-changer for our daily operations.\"</p>\n                              <div class=\"tst1-user\">\n                                <img class=\"tst1-av\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?q=80&w=200&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"User\">\n                                <div><h4 class=\"tst1-name\">David Chen</h4><p class=\"tst1-role\">Marketing Director</p></div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tst1-card\">\n                              <div class=\"tst1-quote-icon\">\"</div>\n                              <div class=\"tst1-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                              <p class=\"tst1-text\">\"Setup took less than five minutes, and we were instantly seeing results. The ROI has been phenomenal. 10/10 would buy again.\"</p>\n                              <div class=\"tst1-user\">\n                                <img class=\"tst1-av\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1438761681033-6461ffad8d80?q=80&w=200&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"User\">\n                                <div><h4 class=\"tst1-name\">Emily Rose</h4><p class=\"tst1-role\">Freelance Designer</p></div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
    },
    {
      "id": "testimonial-2",
      "name": "Masonry Review Grid",
      "description": "A Pinterest-style layout that beautifully accommodates reviews of varying text lengths",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .tst2-wrap{padding:80px 20px;background:#fff;font-family:sans-serif;}\n                          .tst2-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;}\n                          .tst2-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:50px;}\n                          .tst2-head h2{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,44px);font-weight:900;color:#111;margin:0;}\n                          .tst2-grid{column-count:3;column-gap:20px;}\n                          .tst2-card{break-inside:avoid;background:#f9fafb;padding:30px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:20px;border:1px solid #f3f4f6;}\n                          .tst2-stars{color:#10b981;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:15px;letter-spacing:2px;}\n                          .tst2-text{color:#374151;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 20px;}\n                          .tst2-user{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}\n                          .tst2-av{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;}\n                          .tst2-name{font-weight:700;color:#111;margin:0;}\n                          @media(max-width:900px){.tst2-grid{column-count:2;}}\n                          @media(max-width:600px){.tst2-grid{column-count:1;}}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"tst2-wrap\">\n                          <div class=\"tst2-inner\">\n                            <div class=\"tst2-head\">\n                              <h2>Real Stories</h2>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tst2-grid\">\n                              <div class=\"tst2-card\">\n                                <div class=\"tst2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                                <p class=\"tst2-text\">\"Absolutely mind-blowing. I was skeptical at first, but the quality speaks for itself.\"</p>\n                                <div class=\"tst2-user\"><img class=\"tst2-av\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?q=80&w=100&auto=format&fit=crop\"><div class=\"tst2-name\">Alex M.</div></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"tst2-card\">\n                                <div class=\"tst2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                                <p class=\"tst2-text\">\"The best decision our agency made this year. We integrated it into our workflow, and it saved us countless hours. The feature set is robust and the UI is beautiful. Highly recommend to anyone on the fence!\"</p>\n                                <div class=\"tst2-user\"><img class=\"tst2-av\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506794778202-cad84cf45f1d?q=80&w=100&auto=format&fit=crop\"><div class=\"tst2-name\">John D.</div></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"tst2-card\">\n                                <div class=\"tst2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                                <p class=\"tst2-text\">\"Superb customer service! They replied within minutes and solved my issue.\"</p>\n                                <div class=\"tst2-user\"><img class=\"tst2-av\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?q=80&w=100&auto=format&fit=crop\"><div class=\"tst2-name\">Maria S.</div></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"tst2-card\">\n                                <div class=\"tst2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                                <p class=\"tst2-text\">\"I've recommended this to all my colleagues. It's incredibly fast and reliable.\"</p>\n                                <div class=\"tst2-user\"><img class=\"tst2-av\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?q=80&w=100&auto=format&fit=crop\"><div class=\"tst2-name\">Kevin T.</div></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"tst2-card\">\n                                <div class=\"tst2-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                                <p class=\"tst2-text\">\"A perfect 10/10. It does exactly what it promises, and then some. The onboarding was smooth, and the docs are well written.\"</p>\n                                <div class=\"tst2-user\"><img class=\"tst2-av\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531746020798-e6953c6e8e04?q=80&w=100&auto=format&fit=crop\"><div class=\"tst2-name\">Chloe W.</div></div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
    },
    {
      "id": "testimonial-3",
      "name": "Hero Featured Testimonial",
      "description": "A large, split-screen hero style testimonial to highlight your most important client",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .tst3-wrap{padding:80px 20px;background:#1e1b4b;font-family:sans-serif;}\n                          .tst3-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:60px;}\n                          .tst3-content{flex:1;color:#fff;}\n                          .tst3-quote{font-size:clamp(24px,4vw,36px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 30px;}\n                          .tst3-quote-mark{color:#6366f1;font-size:60px;line-height:0;vertical-align:bottom;font-family:serif;}\n                          .tst3-user h4{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#c7d2fe;}\n                          .tst3-user p{margin:0;color:#818cf8;font-size:15px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:700;}\n                          .tst3-img-box{flex:1;position:relative;}\n                          .tst3-img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);}\n                          .tst3-badge{position:absolute;bottom:-20px;left:-20px;background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;}\n                          .tst3-badge-icon{width:40px;height:40px;background:#10b981;border-radius:50%;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:20px;}\n                          .tst3-badge-text{font-weight:800;color:#111;font-size:16px;line-height:1.2;}\n                          @media(max-width:900px){\n                            .tst3-inner{flex-direction:column-reverse;gap:40px;}\n                            .tst3-badge{bottom:-20px;left:20px;}\n                          }\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"tst3-wrap\">\n                          <div class=\"tst3-inner\">\n                            <div class=\"tst3-content\">\n                              <p class=\"tst3-quote\"><span class=\"tst3-quote-mark\">“</span>Working with this team felt like having an unfair advantage. Their attention to detail and creative execution blew us away. The project was delivered ahead of schedule and exceeded all expectations.</p>\n                              <div class=\"tst3-user\">\n                                <h4>Amanda Peterson</h4>\n                                <p>VP of Marketing, GlobalTech</p>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tst3-img-box\">\n                              <img class=\"tst3-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Client\">\n                              <div class=\"tst3-badge\">\n                                <div class=\"tst3-badge-icon\">✓</div>\n                                <div class=\"tst3-badge-text\">200%<br><span style=\"color:#64748b;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;\">Revenue Growth</span></div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
    },
    {
      "id": "testimonial-4",
      "name": "Dark Premium Grid",
      "description": "A dark-themed luxury grid with golden accents and soft borders",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .tst4-wrap{padding:80px 20px;background:#09090b;font-family:sans-serif;}\n                          .tst4-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;}\n                          .tst4-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:60px;}\n                          .tst4-head h2{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,40px);font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:0;}\n                          .tst4-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));gap:30px;}\n                          .tst4-card{background:#18181b;border:1px solid #27272a;border-radius:16px;padding:40px;transition:border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;}\n                          .tst4-card:hover{border-color:#d4af37;transform:translateY(-5px);}\n                          .tst4-stars{color:#d4af37;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:20px;letter-spacing:3px;}\n                          .tst4-text{color:#a1a1aa;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 30px;}\n                          .tst4-user{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;}\n                          .tst4-av{width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;border:2px solid #27272a;}\n                          .tst4-name{font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 3px;}\n                          .tst4-role{color:#71717a;font-size:13px;margin:0;}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"tst4-wrap\">\n                          <div class=\"tst4-inner\">\n                            <div class=\"tst4-head\">\n                              <h2>Elite Client Reviews</h2>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tst4-grid\">\n                              <div class=\"tst4-card\">\n                                <div class=\"tst4-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                                <p class=\"tst4-text\">\"An absolute masterpiece of design and engineering. The luxury feel is unmatched, and the performance is flawless. A truly premium experience.\"</p>\n                                <div class=\"tst4-user\">\n                                  <img class=\"tst4-av\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?q=80&w=150&auto=format&fit=crop\">\n                                  <div><h4 class=\"tst4-name\">Richard B.</h4><p class=\"tst4-role\">Executive Director</p></div>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"tst4-card\">\n                                <div class=\"tst4-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                                <p class=\"tst4-text\">\"We demand nothing but the best, and they delivered exactly that. From start to finish, the service was impeccable and highly professional.\"</p>\n                                <div class=\"tst4-user\">\n                                  <img class=\"tst4-av\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?q=80&w=150&auto=format&fit=crop\">\n                                  <div><h4 class=\"tst4-name\">Eleanor V.</h4><p class=\"tst4-role\">Founder & CEO</p></div>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"tst4-card\">\n                                <div class=\"tst4-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                                <p class=\"tst4-text\">\"Unrivaled quality. It's rare to find a team that understands luxury aesthetics as well as they do. Worth every penny.\"</p>\n                                <div class=\"tst4-user\">\n                                  <img class=\"tst4-av\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?q=80&w=150&auto=format&fit=crop\">\n                                  <div><h4 class=\"tst4-name\">James W.</h4><p class=\"tst4-role\">Chief Architect</p></div>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
    },
    {
      "id": "testimonial-5",
      "name": "Chat Bubble Reviews",
      "description": "A modern, relatable layout where reviews look like friendly chat messages",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .tst5-wrap{padding:80px 20px;background:#f0fdf4;font-family:sans-serif;}\n                          .tst5-inner{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;}\n                          .tst5-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:50px;}\n                          .tst5-head h2{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,36px);font-weight:900;color:#14532d;margin:0;}\n                          .tst5-chat-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:30px;}\n                          .tst5-chat{display:flex;gap:15px;align-items:flex-end;}\n                          .tst5-chat.right{flex-direction:row-reverse;}\n                          .tst5-av{width:45px;height:45px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;}\n                          .tst5-bubble{background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:20px 20px 20px 5px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);max-width:80%;}\n                          .tst5-chat.right .tst5-bubble{border-radius:20px 20px 5px 20px;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;}\n                          .tst5-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#166534;margin:0 0 5px;}\n                          .tst5-chat.right .tst5-name{color:#dcfce7;text-align:right;}\n                          .tst5-text{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#334155;}\n                          .tst5-chat.right .tst5-text{color:#fff;}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"tst5-wrap\">\n                          <div class=\"tst5-inner\">\n                            <div class=\"tst5-head\">\n                              <h2>What People Are Saying</h2>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tst5-chat-list\">\n                              <div class=\"tst5-chat\">\n                                <img class=\"tst5-av\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?q=80&w=100&auto=format&fit=crop\">\n                                <div class=\"tst5-bubble\">\n                                  <p class=\"tst5-name\">Jessica</p>\n                                  <p class=\"tst5-text\">Hey! Just wanted to say I received the package today. The quality is AMAZING! 😍</p>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"tst5-chat right\">\n                                <img class=\"tst5-av\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506794778202-cad84cf45f1d?q=80&w=100&auto=format&fit=crop\">\n                                <div class=\"tst5-bubble\">\n                                  <p class=\"tst5-name\">Michael</p>\n                                  <p class=\"tst5-text\">Honestly, 10/10 experience. Customer support helped me set it up in 5 minutes flat. You guys rock! 🚀</p>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"tst5-chat\">\n                                <img class=\"tst5-av\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?q=80&w=100&auto=format&fit=crop\">\n                                <div class=\"tst5-bubble\">\n                                  <p class=\"tst5-name\">Sophie</p>\n                                  <p class=\"tst5-text\">Best purchase I've made all year. Highly recommend it to anyone looking to save time.</p>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
    }
  ]
